  "question": {
    "text": "What is the minimum energy required to launch a satellite of mass <math> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> </math> from the surface of a planet of mass <math> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </math> and radius <math> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </math> in a circular orbit at an altitude of <math> <mrow> <mtext>2R</mtext> </mrow> </math>?"
