  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know,<br />Gravitational potential cnergy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>GMm</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mfrac></math><br />and orbital velocity, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>GM</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>GMm</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>GMm</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>GMm</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>GMm</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>GMm</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math><br />Therefore minimum required energy,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>GMm</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
